<title>USA: Met-Coil ineligible for Nasdaq Small Cap.</title>
<headline>Met-Coil ineligible for Nasdaq Small Cap.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Met-Coil Systems Corp said Wednesday it is no longer eligible for inclusion on Nasdaq's Small Cap Market.</p>
<p>Its stock will be traded on the OTC Bulletin Board under the symbol &quot;3METS.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said it fell below the minimum net worth requirement, though it meets the other five basic criteria required for inclusion in the Small Cap Market.</p>
<p>Met-Coil supplies sheet metal and glass processing technologies.</p>
<p>	    -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
